We will be holding an Orca Festival at Nagoya Castle!

278
00:11:44,384 --> 00:11:46,384
Yay, Killer Whale!

279
00:11:46,384 --> 00:11:48,384
It's our one-man show for the summer.

280
00:11:48,384 --> 00:11:51,384
Last year, we came back after a long absence.

281
00:11:51,384 --> 00:11:54,384
In the open air and at Nagoya Castle!

282
00:11:54,384 --> 00:11:55,384
The place where we started.

283
00:11:55,384 --> 00:11:57,384
Yes, Nagoya Castle is where we made our debut on the street.

284
00:11:57,384 --> 00:11:59,384
So I'm really looking forward to seeing Orca-sama at the place of my memories.

285
00:11:59,384 --> 00:12:01,384
I'm really looking forward to it!

286
00:12:01,384 --> 00:12:03,384
Just thinking about it makes me emo.

287
00:12:03,384 --> 00:12:05,384
I know, it's so bad, isn't it?

288
00:12:05,384 --> 00:12:06,384
And I'm feeling it too.

289
00:12:06,384 --> 00:12:11,384
After all, it's really hot in Nagoya in the summer.

290
00:12:11,384 --> 00:12:13,384
I want to do a live show that won't let the heat get the better of me.

291
00:12:13,384 --> 00:12:15,384
I'd like to do a live show that won't let the heat get the better of me.

292
00:12:15,384 --> 00:12:19,384
Please come to Nagoya Castle on July 22nd!

293
00:12:19,384 --> 00:12:21,384
We're looking forward to seeing you there!

294
00:12:21,384 --> 00:12:23,384
That's all for now!
